OL,3,AMicrosoft struggling to restore service
OL,4,Aas global outage affects Outlook and
OL,5,ATeams
OL,6,
OL,7,FMicrosoft is struggling to fix a major
OL,8,Fglobal outage of its service that is
OL,9,Freportedly affecting tens of thousands
OL,10,Fof users.
OL,12,FServices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,13,FMicrosoft's artificial intelligence
OL,14,Fsoftware Copilot have been affected by
OL,15,F"connectivity problems".
OL,17,FThe company said in a series of updates
OL,18,Fon X that it was seeing "positive
OL,19,Fresults" with its efforts to restore
OL,20,Fservices and that it was rushing to fix
OL,21,Fthe problem.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
