OL,3,ARussell Brand's social media accounts
OL,4,Adisabled by Meta
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand's social media accounts
OL,7,Fon platforms owned by tech company Meta
OL,8,Fhave been disabled.
OL,10,FIt comes after the 51-year-old former
OL,11,Fentertainer was sentenced to
OL,12,F10-and-a-half-years in jail for one
OL,13,Fcount of rape and three counts of
OL,14,Fsexual assault earlier this week.
OL,16,FHe was found guilty of the charges
OL,17,Finvolving four women and relating to
OL,18,Foffences between 2004 and 2009.
OL,20,FMeta owns social media platforms
OL,21,Fincluding Instagram and Facebook.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
